{"3444080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bakery Cafe Simulator", "steam_appid": 3444080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or up to 4 players online. Open your own Bakery café and grow your business by serving your customers the delicious dishes you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and furnish your café according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or up to 4 players online. Open your own Bakery café and grow your business by serving your customers the delicious dishes you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and furnish your café according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>", "short_description": "Bake, build, and grow your dream bakery cafe! Create delicious pastries, design your space, and serve customers. Play solo or with friends in online co-op to expand your business and experience the excitement of running a bustling cafe!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/39897fe22ba204a2dfeb7855c7ad4eef7f61e514/header.jpg?t=1784627682", "capsule_image": "https://shared.ak